'''HMS ''Crusader''''' was a [[Tribal-class destroyer (1905)|Tribal-class]] [[destroyer]] of the [[Royal Navy]] launched in 1909. During the [[First World War]] she served in the [[North Sea]] and the [[English Channel]] with the [[6th Destroyer Flotilla]]. Following the War she was sold for scrap to [[Thos. W. Ward]] on 30 June 1920 for scrapping at Preston.

